      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i live in an apartment in berlin and the radiator in my bedroom isn't working at all. its freezing in here. can you help me write a formal letter to my Hausverwaltung (the property management) to report this and tell them they need to fix it urgently? i need it to sound professional and serious so they actually take it seriously.",
